{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Pyromancer Phoenix follows across dungeon and map teleports (#13473)",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #13473: Phoenix Egg (800796) summons Phoenix (50258) with SummonProperties 1561 (SUMMON_CATEGORY_PET, a controllable Guardian) through AscensionPyromancer::Summon. Because Summon() omitted the creating spellId when calling Map::SummonCreature, UNIT_CREATED_BY_SPELL stayed 0, so AscensionGuardianTravel::Arrive rejected recreation on map changes (SummonSpellAllowsHere(player, 0) returned false) and the Phoenix despawned on every dungeon transition.",
    "With spellId 800796 recorded on the summon, Phoenix travels with the Pyromancer when entering a dungeon (Orgrimmar map 1 -> Ragefire Chasm map 389 via area trigger 2230), exiting it (area trigger 2226 -> map 1), and teleporting across maps (map 1 -> map 0). Needs CoA.Guardians.FollowTravel = 1 (the default in coa.conf.dist).",
    "Expected: after initial cast and after each of the three map transitions, owned_creature_count for entry 50258 is 1 and pet_entry is 50258. Before the fix, owned_creature_count and pet_entry drop to 0 on the first dungeon entry."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "location": {
    "map": 1,
    "x": 1818.4,
    "y": -4427.26,
    "z": -10.4478,
    "o": 4.0
  },
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "pyro",
      "race": 2,
      "class": 24,
      "level": 35,
      "security": 0
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "label": "Let login settle",
      "ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "action": "learn",
      "actor": "pyro",
      "spell": 800796
    },
    {
      "action": "set_power",
      "actor": "pyro",
      "power": 0,
      "value": 2000
    },
    {
      "action": "cast",
      "label": "Summon Phoenix with Phoenix Egg (800796)",
      "actor": "pyro",
      "spell": 800796,
      "destination": {
        "x": 1816.4,
        "y": -4427.26,
        "z": -10.4478
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "SETUP: Phoenix (50258) is owned",
      "actor": "pyro",
      "metric": "owned_creature_count",
      "entry": 50258,
      "equals": 1,
      "within_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "SETUP: Phoenix (50258) is active controllable pet",
      "actor": "pyro",
      "metric": "pet_entry",
      "equals": 50258,
      "within_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "label": "Let Phoenix enter FollowOwner motion",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
